        "lessons": [
          {
            "title": "Lesson #12",
            "id": 132665,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Quale metodo HTTP viene utilizzato per inviare dati al server?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>POST</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>GET</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>POST</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>La raccolta <code>/players</code> contiene dieci giocatori. Invi un nuovo profilo per aggiungerne un undicesimo. Quale metodo è adatto?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>POST</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>GET</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>PUT</code></item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\"><code>PATCH</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>POST</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "PUT Body - Copy",
            "id": 132677,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Crea un endpoint <code>PUT</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"app.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"app.put(\" /><text value=\"&quot;/users&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", (req, res) =&gt; {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"4\" endIndex=\"7\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"get\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>put</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Registra <code>/users</code> per le richieste che sostituiscono i dati utente, anziché leggerli, crearli, aggiornarli in parte o eliminarli.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"app.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"app.put(\" /><text value=\"&quot;/users&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", (req, res) =&gt; {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"4\" endIndex=\"7\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"post\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"patch\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"delete\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>put</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #22",
            "id": 132686,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Quale codice di stato HTTP viene generalmente restituito quando una richiesta <code>PATCH</code> aggiorna correttamente una risorsa?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>200 OK</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>201 Created</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>200 OK</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Una richiesta <code>PATCH</code> modifica un utente esistente e ha esito positivo. Quale stato deve restituire il server?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>200 OK</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>201 Created</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>204 No Content</code></item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\"><code>404 Not Found</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>200 OK</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #23",
            "id": 132687,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Che cosa dovrebbe restituire il server se la risorsa da modificare non viene trovata?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>404 Not Found</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>400 Internal Server Error</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>200 OK</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>404 Not Found</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Una richiesta <code>PATCH</code> riguarda un utente inesistente. Un'altra riguarda un utente esistente, ma omette un'email obbligatoria.</p><p>Quali codici di stato corrispondono a questi errori, in questo ordine?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>404</code>, poi <code>400</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>400</code>, poi <code>404</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>404</code>, poi <code>200</code></item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\"><code>500</code>, poi <code>400</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>404</code>, poi <code>400</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: PUT Body JSON - Copy",
            "id": 132679,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Crea un endpoint <code>PUT</code> per aggiornare un animale domestico specifico.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"app.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"app.put(\" /><text value=\"&quot;/pet/:id&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", (req, res) =&gt; {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Moo!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"3\" /><option startIndex=\"3\" endIndex=\"4\" /><option startIndex=\"4\" endIndex=\"7\" /><option startIndex=\"13\" endIndex=\"18\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"post\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"9\" endIndex=\"13\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Moo!\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>app</code>, seguito da <code>.</code> e poi <code>put</code>, <code>/pet</code>, <code>/:id\"</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Completa la route che sostituisce l'animale identificato da <code>/pet/:id</code> e registra <code>Moo!</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"app.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"app.put(\" /><text value=\"&quot;/pet/:id&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", (req, res) =&gt; {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Moo!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"3\" /><option startIndex=\"3\" endIndex=\"4\" /><option startIndex=\"4\" endIndex=\"7\" /><option startIndex=\"13\" endIndex=\"18\" /><option startIndex=\"9\" endIndex=\"13\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"post\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"patch\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"/users/:id\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Moo!\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>app</code>, seguito da <code>.</code>, <code>put</code>, <code>/pet</code> e infine <code>/:id\"</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: POST Body 2 - Copy",
            "id": 132690,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Imposta il codice corretto per indicare che l'operazione è riuscita.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"app.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"app.delete(\" /><text value=\"&quot;/users/:id&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", (req, res) =&gt; {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" res.status(\" /><text value=\"204\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"53\" endIndex=\"56\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"201\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"200\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"User deleted\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>204</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Completa la cancellazione riuscita con lo stato nessun contenuto e senza corpo della risposta.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"app.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"app\" /><text value=\".\" /><text value=\"delete\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"&quot;/users/:id&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"req\" /><text value=\",\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"res\" /><text value=\")\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"res\" /><text value=\".\" /><text value=\"status\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"204\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\")\" /><text value=\".\" /><text value=\"send\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\")\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text value=\")\" /><text value=\";\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"53\" endIndex=\"56\" /><option startIndex=\"58\" endIndex=\"62\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"200\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"201\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"status\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>204</code>, seguito da <code>send</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #13",
            "id": 132666,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Cosa dovrebbe fare il server quando riceve la richiesta POST?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Salva i dati con i campi forniti</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Aggiorna un articolo esistente con lo stesso nome</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Salva i dati con i campi forniti.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Esistono due record di giocatori. Ne crei un altro con <code>POST /players</code>, impostando <code>username</code> su <code>DauT</code>.</p><p>Quale risultato corrisponde a questa richiesta di creazione?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Tre record, incluso un nuovo record con username DauT.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Due record, con un giocatore esistente sostituito da DauT.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Due record invariati; la richiesta restituisce solo i dati del giocatore.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Tre record, incluso un nuovo record con username DauT.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "PUT Body 2 - Copy -  - Copy - Copy",
            "id": 132683,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Invia un messaggio e imposta il codice di stato corretto.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"app.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"app.patch(\" /><text value=\"&quot;/users/:id&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", (req, res) =&gt; {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" res.status(\" /><text value=\"200\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\").send(\" /><text value=\"&quot;User updated&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"41\" endIndex=\"44\" /><option startIndex=\"44\" endIndex=\"45\" /><option startIndex=\"45\" endIndex=\"56\" /><option startIndex=\"56\" endIndex=\"57\" /><option startIndex=\"57\" endIndex=\"61\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"json\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"status(201)\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"User updated\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>res</code>, seguito da <code>.</code> e poi <code>status(200)</code>, <code>.</code>, <code>send</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Rispondi alla richiesta <code>PATCH /users/:id</code> riuscita con lo stato <code>200</code> e il testo semplice <code>User updated</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"app.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"app.patch(\" /><text value=\"&quot;/users/:id&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", (req, res) =&gt; {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" res.status(\" /><text value=\"200\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\").send(\" /><text value=\"&quot;User updated&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"41\" endIndex=\"44\" /><option startIndex=\"44\" endIndex=\"45\" /><option startIndex=\"45\" endIndex=\"56\" /><option startIndex=\"56\" endIndex=\"57\" /><option startIndex=\"57\" endIndex=\"61\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"json\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"status(201)\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"req\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"User updated\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>res</code>, seguito da <code>.</code>, <code>status(200)</code>, <code>.</code> e infine <code>send</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #15",
            "id": 132676,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Quando crei un endpoint <code>PUT</code>, in genere hai bisogno di un parametro di route?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Sì, per identificare la risorsa</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">No, la risorsa da aggiornare viene determinata dal corpo della richiesta</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Sì, per identificare la risorsa.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Una richiesta sostituisce il giocatore in <code>/players/42</code>. Perché la route <code>PUT</code> ha bisogno di <code>:id</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Identifica il giocatore da aggiornare.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Memorizza tutti i campi sostitutivi nell'URL.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Trasforma la richiesta in una <code>POST</code>.</item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\">Crea automaticamente un nuovo giocatore.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Identifica il giocatore da aggiornare.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "POST Body - Copy",
            "id": 132668,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Crea un endpoint <code>POST</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"app.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"app.post(\" /><text value=\"&quot;/users&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", (req, res) =&gt; {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"4\" endIndex=\"8\" /></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di digitare <code>post</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "POST Body 2 - Copy - Copy - Copy",
            "id": 132671,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Accedi alla proprietà <code>username</code> dei dati della richiesta.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"app.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"app.post(\" /><text value=\"&quot;/players&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", (req, res) =&gt; {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" requestData = req.body;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" username = requestData.username;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(username);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"98\" endIndex=\"106\" /><option startIndex=\"86\" endIndex=\"97\" /><option startIndex=\"97\" endIndex=\"98\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"body\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"DauT\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>requestData</code>, seguito da <code>.</code> e infine <code>username</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Leggi l'username inviato dal corpo memorizzato in questa callback, poi registralo nella console.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"app.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"app.post(\" /><text value=\"&quot;/players&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", (req, res) =&gt; {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" requestData = req.body;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" username = requestData.username;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(username);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"98\" endIndex=\"106\" /><option startIndex=\"86\" endIndex=\"97\" /><option startIndex=\"97\" endIndex=\"98\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"password\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"res.body\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"req.params\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"DauT\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>requestData</code>, seguito da <code>.</code> e infine <code>username</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          }
